id=ishtar_aon_fix
name=ishtar AON front config fix
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=ishtar arastirma
description=[bind-mount] Eksik /vendor/lib64/camera/aon_front.pb yolunu olusturur. AON -> CSS -> NCS zincirini onarir; diyafram, OIS, lazer AF (ToF) ve yuz-sahne icin NCS saglayicilari olusur. KernelSU modul baglamasina BAGIMLI DEGILDIR. Yalnizca Xiaomi 13 Ultra (ishtar).
